{
 "version": 1,
 "agreed": "2026-11-09 (BIZZ & DEVICE: LynkDriver, one driver pack for the whole ecosystem)",
 "rule": "LynkDriver is one free, signed pack that drives every kind of hardware LynkOmni uses. It installs online from Devices > Driver in the Business app or offline from lynkomni.com/download/driver, and the app asks to install it as soon as hardware that needs it is attached. Updates are strongly enforced: a security update is required now, a required update within 3 days, a normal update within 7 days. Past the deadline the hardware pauses and the matching virtual device takes over, so a sale is never blocked. Payment card readers and fiscal devices are certified by their licensed provider or authority; LynkDriver only connects them. core/drivers.py and ts/src/drivers.ts apply this file. NEW UPDATE 1 (2026-11-10): vehicle trackers, OBD plugs, tags, e-seals, condition sensors and satellite trackers are hardware on demand for LynkMotion and LynkGuard; the phone stands in as the tracker and a sealed photo stands in for an e-seal.",
 "software_only": {
  "rule": "LynkOmni gives software only (owner rule, blueprint 48 and 89.1). Every piece of hardware comes from the user and connects through open standards or LynkDriver; any applicable hardware works. LynkOmni hardware is supplied only when the user orders it, never needed to start and never part of a plan. Every hardware kind has a stand-in on a phone or screen, or a written reason why it cannot have one.",
  "supplied_by": "user",
  "lynkomni_hardware": "only_when_ordered"
 },
